    <briefdescription>
<para>A base class. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A number of filters work on disjoint sets of the input particles. These can be specified in several different ways<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>implicitly via having the same <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1ParticleStates" kindref="compound">ParticleStates</ref> objects</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>as a list of particle equivalencies</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>as a list of disjoint sets of equivalent particles </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
